  "description": "Teton is a single play tower with a Forest Green roof, in the Woody series of our NexLev range. Children go up a net ladder, play under the roof and come down a double slide. A ring traverse runs out from the tower, so they can also cross hand over hand under the overhead rings. The roof shades the deck on hot afternoons. Teton takes 30 to 35 children. It needs 23'7\" x 22'7\" for the product and 29'7\" x 28'7\" for the safe play area, a near-square shape for a society lawn or a school yard. Listed skills are strength, self control and motor skills. The 3-year warranty covers its galvanised pipe, moulded slide, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us how Teton fits beside your other equipment.",
